#. module: fsm_job_profitability
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:fsm_job_profitability.action_fsm_tech_job_report
msgid ""
"Analyze job-level revenue and hours allocated to each technician\n"
"                    based on their share of effective hours on FSM jobs."
msgstr ""
"Analysez les revenus par travail et les heures attribuées à chaque technicien\n"
"                    selon sa part des heures effectives sur les travaux FSM."

#. module: fsm_job_profitability
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:fsm_job_profitability.action_report_fsm_job
